{"audit_id":"math2.lilin880.first-three-chapters.20260821","chapter_id":"math2.calculus.ch03","source_section":"高数第二章｜基础解答","source_pdf_pages":[152],"item_ref":"ch02.basic.solution.011","item_kind":"nonchoice","prompt":"f 二阶可导，f(0)=0,f'(0)=1,f''(0)=2，求 lim [f(x)−x]/x²。","topic_tags":["二阶可导","泰勒公式"],"type_pool":"微分","subquestions":[{"label":"主问","formal_answer":"1","official_analysis":"二阶泰勒展开 f(x)=x+x²+o(x²)。","independent_check":"不能把 f''(x) 直接换为 f''(0)，因为未给 f'' 连续。","status":"verified"}],"official_answer_source_pages":[44],"source_status":"题面文本层与答案视觉核验。","verification_status":"verified","reviewed_at":"2026-08-21T17:35:00+08:00","reviewed_by":"Codex"}
